      "reviews": "“I was impressed that something with as many sight gags and one-liners about video games as Healer’s Quest had some serious RPG chops to it.”<br>- Polygon<br><br>“It’s actually an RPG, and by all reports a pretty good one. If you like stats and meter juggling and, uh, RPGs, it looks like a neat breath of fresh air.”<br>- PC Gamer<br><br>“The cutesy characters, beautiful pastel-shaded graphics and superb soundtrack make for an appealing adventure”<br>- GameSpew<br>",
